    {
      "content_type": "heading",
      "text": "八 装饰方块",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "content_type": "text",
      "text": "点击下面的物品条目直接跳转。"
    },
    {
      "content_type": "toc_list",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "桌椅与王座",
          "category_link": "decoration",
          "anchor": "entry_067"
        },
        {
          "text": "火坑与火盆",
          "category_link": "decoration",
          "anchor": "entry_068"
        },
        {
          "text": "祭坛布与祭坛蜡烛",
          "category_link": "decoration",
